I have the new key in my hand.
I am standing near the door.
I put the key in the lock.
I open the door.
I go inside.
Asha is standing behind me.
This is the living room.
I look everywhere in the room.
There is a lot of light in the room.
There is a big window there.
There is sunlight on the floor.
There is a nice sofa near the wall.
There is a small table in front of the sofa.
There is a vase on the table.
All the furniture is already in the room.
I am very happy.
This is my permanent home in Mumbai now.
I look at Asha and smile.
